# End-to-end Two Lives flow with a test bot (no Trial). Expect, in order: bot in ttl:mortal_realm with
# phase=life1; after the kill phase=corridor step=wish in ttl:spirit_corridor; step=race with wish=knowledge;
# then phase=life2 in minecraft:overworld with a tensura: unique in ttl.uniques. Slime is always offered.
ttlbot spawn TtlBotRebirth
neoforge tps
neoforge tps
ttl inspect TtlBotRebirth
kill TtlBotRebirth
neoforge tps
ttl inspect TtlBotRebirth
execute as TtlBotRebirth run ttl wish knowledge
ttl inspect TtlBotRebirth
execute as TtlBotRebirth run ttl choose slime
neoforge tps
ttl inspect TtlBotRebirth
ttl reset TtlBotRebirth
ttl inspect TtlBotRebirth
ttlbot remove TtlBotRebirth
